#: kdm-appear.cpp:71
msgid "&Greeting:"
msgstr "groete:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:76
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This is the string KDM will display in the login window. You may want to put "
"here some nice greeting or information about the operating system."
"<p> KDM will replace the string '%n' with the actual host name of the "
"computer running the X server. Especially in networks this is a good idea."
msgstr ""
"hierdie is die string kdm sal vertoon in die aanteken venster. jy dalk mag "
"wil hê aan plaas hier sommige oulike groete van informasie aangaande die "
"operating stelsel."
"<p> kdm sal vervang die string '%n' met die ware bediener naam van die "
"rekenaar wat loop die x bediener. in besonder in netwerke hierdie is 'n "
"goeie idee."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:90
msgid "Logo area:"
msgstr "embleem area:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:95 kdm-conv.cpp:79 kdm-users.cpp:150
msgid "&None"
msgstr "geen"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:96
msgid "Show cloc&k"
msgstr "vertoon horlosie"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:97
msgid "Sho&w logo"
msgstr "vertoon embleem"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:109
msgid ""
"You can choose to display a custom logo (see below), a clock or no logo at "
"all."
msgstr ""
"jy kan kies aan vertoon 'n pasmaak embleem (sien onder), 'n horlosie of nee "
"embleem na alle."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:115
msgid "&Logo:"
msgstr "embleem:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:127
msgid ""
"Click here to choose an image that KDM will display. You can also drag and "
"drop an image onto this button (e.g. from Konqueror)."
msgstr ""
"kliek hier aan kies 'n beeld wat kdm sal vertoon. jy kan asook trek en laat "
"val 'n beeld op hierdie knoppie (e.g. van konqueror)."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:140
msgid "Position:"
msgstr "posisie:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:145
msgid "Cente&red"
msgstr "gesentreer"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:146
msgid "Spec&ify"
msgstr "spesifiseer"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:156
msgid ""
"You can choose whether the login dialog should be centered or placed at "
"specified coordinates."
msgstr ""
"jy kan kies hetsy die aanteken dialoog moet wees gesentreer of rangorde na "
"gespesifiseer koördinate."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:165
msgid "&X"
msgstr "x"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:171
msgid "&Y"
msgstr "y"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:177
msgid "Here you specify the coordinates of the login dialog's <em>center</em>."
msgstr ""

#: kdm-appear.cpp:193
msgid "GUI S&tyle:"
msgstr "gui styl:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:197
msgid "You can choose a basic GUI style here that will be used by KDM only."
msgstr ""
"jy kan kies 'n basiese gui styl hier wat sal wees gebruik word deur kdm "
"slegs."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:202
msgid "Echo &mode:"
msgstr "ego modus:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:205
msgid "No echo"
msgstr "nee ego"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:206
msgid "One Star"
msgstr "een ster"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:207
msgid "Three Stars"
msgstr "drie sterre"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:211
msgid "You can choose whether and how KDM shows your password when you type it."
msgstr "jy kan kies hetsy en hoe kdm vertoon jou wagwoord wanneer jy tipe dit."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:217
msgid "Locale"
msgstr "lokalisering"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:223
msgid "Languag&e:"
msgstr "taal:"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:232
msgid ""
"Here you can choose the language used by KDM. This setting doesn't affect a "
"user's personal settings that will take effect after login."
msgstr ""

#: kdm-appear.cpp:276
msgid "without name"
msgstr "sonder om te naam"

#: kdm-appear.cpp:371
msgid ""
"There was an error loading the image:\n"
"%1\n"
"It will not be saved."
msgstr ""
"daar was 'n fout laaiïng van die beeld:\n"
"%1\n"
"dit sal nie wees gestoor."

#: kdm-appear.cpp:413 kdm-appear.cpp:460
#, c-format
msgid "Welcome to %s at %n"
msgstr ""

#: kdm-appear.cpp:474
msgid ""
"<h1>KDM - Appearance</h1>"
" Here you can configure the basic appearance of the KDM login manager, i.e. "
"a greeting string, an icon etc."
"<p> For further refinement of KDM's appearance, see the \"Font\" and "
"\"Background\"  tabs."
msgstr ""

#: kdm-font.cpp:46
msgid "Select fonts"
msgstr "kies skriftipes"

#: kdm-font.cpp:49
msgid "Greeting"
msgstr "groete"

#: kdm-font.cpp:50
msgid "Fail"
msgstr "faal"

#: kdm-font.cpp:51
msgid "Standard"
msgstr "standaard"

#: kdm-font.cpp:55
msgid ""
"Here you can select the font you want to change. KDM knows three fonts: "
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Greeting:</em> used to display KDM's greeting string (see "
"\"Appearance\" tab)</li>"
"<li><em>Fail:</em> used to display a message when a person fails to "
"login</li><li><em>Standard:</em> used for the rest of the text</li></ul>"
msgstr ""

#: kdm-font.cpp:60
msgid "C&hange Font..."
msgstr "verander skrif tipe..."

#: kdm-font.cpp:64
msgid "Click here to change the selected font."
msgstr "kliek hier aan verander die gekose skrif tipe."

#: kdm-font.cpp:68
msgid "Example"
msgstr "voorbeeld"

#: kdm-font.cpp:69
msgid "Shows a preview of the selected font."
msgstr "vertoon 'n voorskou van die gekose skrif tipe."

#: kdm-font.cpp:76
msgid "Use Anti-Aliasing for fonts"
msgstr "gebruik Anti-Aliasing vir skriftipes"

#: kdm-font.cpp:77
msgid ""
"If you check this box and your X-Server has the Xft extension, fonts will be "
"antialiased (smoothed) in the login dialog."
msgstr ""

#: kdm-font.cpp:185
msgid "Greeting font"
msgstr "groete skrif tipe"

#: kdm-font.cpp:189
msgid "Fail font"
msgstr "faal skrif tipe"

#: kdm-font.cpp:193
msgid "Standard font"
msgstr "standaard skrif tipe"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:50
msgid "Allow shutdown"
msgstr "toelaat afskakel"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:53
msgid "Co&nsole:"
msgstr "konsole:"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:54 kdm-sess.cpp:60
msgid "Everybody"
msgstr "almal"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:55 kdm-sess.cpp:61
msgid "Only root"
msgstr "slegs root"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:56 kdm-sess.cpp:62
msgid "Nobody"
msgstr "niemand"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:59
msgid "Re&mote:"
msgstr "afgeleë:"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:64
msgid ""
"Here you can select who is allowed to shutdown the computer using KDM. You "
"can specify different values for local (console) and remote displays. "
"Possible values are:"
"<ul> "
"<li><em>Everybody:</em> everybody can shutdown the computer using KDM</li> "
"<li><em>Only root:</em> KDM will only allow shutdown after the user has "
"entered the root password</li> "
"<li><em>Nobody:</em> nobody can shutdown the computer using KDM</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"hier jy kan kies wie is toegelaat aan afskakel die rekenaar te gebruik kdm. "
"jy kan spesifiseer ander waardes vir plaaslike (konsole) en afgeleë "
"vertoon. moontlik waardes word:"
"<ul> "
"<li><em>almal:</em> almal kan afskakel die rekenaar te gebruik kdm</li> "
"<li><em>slegs root:</em>"
" kdm sal slegs toelaat afskakel na die gebruiker het ingevoerde die root "
"wagwoord</li> "
"<li><em>niemand:</em> niemand kan afskakel die rekenaar te gebruik "
"kdm</li></ul>"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:72
msgid "Commands"
msgstr "opdragte"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:75
msgid "Ha&lt"
msgstr "halt"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:78
msgid "Command to initiate the system halt. Typical value: /sbin/halt"
msgstr "opdrag aan inisieer die stelsel halt. tipies waarde: /sbin/halt"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:83
msgid "&Reboot"
msgstr "herboot"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:86
msgid "Command to initiate the system reboot. Typical value: /sbin/reboot"
msgstr "opdrag aan inisieer die stelsel herboot. tipies waarde: /sbin/herboot"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:91
msgid "Lilo"
msgstr "lilo"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:93
msgid "Show boot opt&ions"
msgstr "vertoon boot opsies"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:98
msgid "Enable Lilo boot options in the \"Shutdown ...\" dialog."
msgstr "aktiveer lilo boot opsies in die \"afskakel ...\" dialoog."

#: kdm-sess.cpp:102
msgid "Lilo command"
msgstr "lilo opdrag"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:105
msgid "Command to run Lilo. Typical value: /sbin/lilo"
msgstr "opdrag aan hardloop lilo. tipies waarde: /sbin/lilo"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:110
msgid "Lilo map file"
msgstr "lilo kaart lêer"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:113
msgid "Position of Lilo's map file. Typical value: /boot/map"
msgstr ""

#: kdm-sess.cpp:118
msgid "Session types"
msgstr "sessie tipes"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:121
msgid "New t&ype"
msgstr "nuwe tipe"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:128
msgid ""
"To create a new session type, enter its name here and click on <em>Add "
"new</em>"
msgstr ""
"aan skep 'n nuwe sessie tipe, invoer sy naam hier en kliek op <em>voeg by "
"<-invoer->nuwe</em>"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:132
msgid "Add Ne&w"
msgstr "voeg by nuwe"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:136
msgid ""
"Click here to add the new session type entered in the <em>New type</em> "
"field to the list of available sessions."
msgstr ""
"kliek hier aan voeg by die nuwe sessie tipe ingevoerde in die <em>nuwe "
"tipe</em> veld aan die lys van beskikbaar sessies."

#: kdm-sess.cpp:139
msgid "Available &types"
msgstr "beskikbaar tipes"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:142
msgid ""
"This box lists the available session types that will be presented to the "
"user. Names other than \"default\" and \"failsafe\" are usually treated as "
"program names, but it depends on your Xsession script what the session type "
"means."
msgstr ""
"hierdie boks lyste die beskikbaar sessie tipes wat sal wees aangebied aan "
"die gebruiker. name ander as \"verstek\" en \"vaal-veilig\" word gewoonlik "
"behandel as program name, maar dit hang af op jou xsessie skrip wat die "
"sessie tipe beteken."

#: kdm-sess.cpp:148
msgid "R&emove"
msgstr "verwyder"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:152
msgid "Click here to remove the currently selected session type"
msgstr "kliek hier aan verwyder die huidiglik gekose sessie tipe"

#: kdm-sess.cpp:164
msgid ""
"With these two arrow buttons, you can change the order in which the "
"available session types are presented to the user"
msgstr ""
"met hierdie twee pyl knoppies, jy kan verander die volgorde in wat die "
"beskikbaar sessie tipes word aangebied aan die gebruiker"

#: backgnd.cpp:90
msgid "abcdefgh"
msgstr "abcdefgh"

#: backgnd.cpp:104
msgid ""
"Here you can see a preview of how KDM's background will look like using the "
"current settings. You can even set a background picture by dragging it onto "
"the preview (e.g. from Konqueror)."
msgstr ""

#: backgnd.cpp:114
msgid "Back&ground"
msgstr "agtergrond"

#: backgnd.cpp:123 backgnd.cpp:189 bgdialogs.cpp:683
msgid "&Mode:"
msgstr "modus:"

#: backgnd.cpp:132
msgid ""
"Here you can change the way colors are applied to KDM's background. Apart of "
"just a plain color you can choose gradients, custom patterns or a background "
"program (e.g. xearth)."
msgstr ""

#: backgnd.cpp:138
msgid "Color &1:"
msgstr "kleur 1:"

#: backgnd.cpp:148
msgid ""
"By clicking on these buttons you can choose the colors KDM will use to paint "
"the background. If you selected a gradient or a pattern, you can choose two "
"colors."
msgstr ""
"deur te kliek op hierdie knoppies jy kan kies die kleure kdm sal gebruik aan "
"verf die agtergrond. as jy gekose 'n gradiënt of 'n patroon, jy kan kies "
"twee kleure."

#: backgnd.cpp:154
msgid "Color &2:"
msgstr "kleur 2:"

#: backgnd.cpp:169 backgnd.cpp:236
msgid "S&etup"
msgstr "opstelling"

#: backgnd.cpp:175
msgid "Click here to setup a pattern or a background program."
msgstr "kliek hier aan opstelling 'n patroon of 'n agtergrond program."

#: backgnd.cpp:180
msgid "Wa&llpaper"
msgstr "muurpapier"

#: backgnd.cpp:198
msgid ""
"Here you can choose the way the selected picture will be used to cover KDM's "
"background. If you select \"No Wallpaper\", the colors settings will be used."
msgstr ""

#: backgnd.cpp:203
msgid "&Wallpaper"
msgstr "muurpapier"

#: backgnd.cpp:213
msgid ""
"Here you can choose from several wallpaper pictures, i.e. pictures that have "
"been installed in the system's or your wallpaper directory. If you want to "
"use other pictures, you can either click on the \"Browse\" button or drag a "
"picture (e.g. from Konqueror) onto the preview."
msgstr ""
"hier jy kan kies van klomp muurpapier prentjies, i.e. prentjies wat het al "
"geïnstalleer in die stelsel se of jou muurpapier gids. as jy wil hê aan "
"gebruik ander prentjies, jy kan òf kliek op die \"blaai\" knoppie of trek "
"'n prent (e.g. van konqueror) op die voorskou."

#: backgnd.cpp:222
msgid "B&rowse"
msgstr "blaai"

#: backgnd.cpp:228
msgid "Click here to choose a wallpaper using a file dialog."
msgstr "kliek hier aan kies 'n muurpapier te gebruik 'n lêer dialoog."

#: backgnd.cpp:230
msgid "Mul&tiple:"
msgstr "veelvuldige:"

#: backgnd.cpp:281
msgid "Flat"
msgstr "plat"

#: backgnd.cpp:282 bgdialogs.cpp:367
msgid "Pattern"
msgstr "patroon"

#: backgnd.cpp:283
msgid "Background Program"
msgstr "agtergrond program"

#: backgnd.cpp:284
msgid "Horizontal Gradient"
msgstr "horisontaal gradiënt"

#: backgnd.cpp:285
msgid "Vertical Gradient"
msgstr "vertikaal gradiënt"

#: backgnd.cpp:286
msgid "Pyramid Gradient"
msgstr "piramiede gradiënt"

#: backgnd.cpp:287
msgid "Pipecross Gradient"
msgstr "pyp kruising gradiënt"

#: backgnd.cpp:288
msgid "Elliptic Gradient"
msgstr "eliptiese gradiënt"

#: backgnd.cpp:300
msgid "No Wallpaper"
msgstr "nee muurpapier"

#: backgnd.cpp:301
msgid "Centred"
msgstr "gesentreer"

#: backgnd.cpp:302
msgid "Tiled"
msgstr "geteël"

#: backgnd.cpp:303
msgid "Center Tiled"
msgstr "sentrum geteël"

#: backgnd.cpp:304
msgid "Centred Maxpect"
msgstr "gesentreer maks_aspek"

#: backgnd.cpp:305
msgid "Scaled"
msgstr "skaleer"

#: backgnd.cpp:569
#, fuzzy
msgid "Currently only local wallpapers are allowed."
msgstr "huidiglik word slegs plaaslike wallpapers toegelaat."

#: kdm-users.cpp:51 kdm-users.cpp:58
#, c-format
msgid "Couldn't create directory %1"
msgstr ""

#: kdm-users.cpp:61
msgid "<default>"
msgstr "<default>"

#: kdm-users.cpp:65
msgid "&Remaining users"
msgstr "oor gebruikers"

#: kdm-users.cpp:67
msgid "S&elected users"
msgstr "gekose gebruikers"

#: kdm-users.cpp:69
msgid "No-sho&w users"
msgstr "No-show gebruikers"

#: kdm-users.cpp:77
msgid ""
"Click here to add the highlighted user on the left to the list of selected "
"users on the right, i.e. users that should in any case be shown in KDM's "
"user list."
msgstr ""

#: kdm-conv.cpp:145 kdm-users.cpp:84
msgid "Click here to remove the highlighted user from the list of selected users."
msgstr ""
"kliek hier aan verwyder die verlig gebruiker van die lys van gekose "
"gebruikers."

#: kdm-users.cpp:91
msgid ""
"Click here to add the highlighted user on the left to the list of users "
"explicitly not shown by KDM."
msgstr ""
"kliek hier aan voeg deur die verlig gebruiker op die links aan die lys van "
"gebruikers eksplisiet nie vertoon deur kdm."

#: kdm-users.cpp:98
msgid ""
"Click here to remove the highlighted user from the list of users explicitly "
"not shown by KDM."
msgstr ""
"kliek hier aan verwyder die verlig gebruiker van die lys van gebruikers "
"eksplisiet nie vertoon deur kdm."

#: kdm-users.cpp:103
msgid ""
"This is the list of users for which no explicit show policy has been set, "
"i.e. they will only be shown by KDM if \"Show users\" is \"all but no-show\"."
msgstr ""
"hierdie is die lys van gebruikers vir wat nee eksplisiet vertoon beleid het "
"al stel, i.e. hulle sal slegs wees vertoon deur kdm as \"vertoon "
"gebruikers\" is \"alle maar nee-vertoon\"."

#: kdm-users.cpp:110
msgid "This is the list of users KDM will show in its login dialog in any case."
msgstr ""
"hierdie is die lys van gebruikers kdm sal vertoon in sy aanteken dialoog in "
"enige kas."

#: kdm-users.cpp:116
msgid ""
"This is the list of users KDM will not show in its login dialog. Users "
"(except for root) with a user ID less than the one specified in the \"Hide "
"UIDs\" fields will not be shown, too."
msgstr ""
"hierdie is die lys van gebruikers kdm sal nie vertoon in sy aanteken "
"dialoog. gebruikers (behalwe vir root) met 'n gebruiker id minder as die een "
"gespesifiseer in die \"steek weg uids\" velde sal nie wees vertoon, te."

#: kdm-users.cpp:140
msgid "Click or drop an image here"
msgstr "kliek of laat val 'n beeld hier"

#: kdm-users.cpp:141
msgid ""
"Here you can see the username of the currently selected user and the image "
"assigned to this user. Click on the image button to select from a list of "
"images or drag and drop your own image onto the button (e.g. from Konqueror)."
msgstr ""
"hier jy kan sien die gebruikernaam van die huidiglik gekose gebruiker en die "
"beeld toegeskryf aan hierdie gebruiker. kliek op die beeld knoppie aan kies "
"van 'n lys van beelde of trek en laat val jou eie beeld op die knoppie (e.g. "
"van konqueror)."

#: kdm-users.cpp:147
msgid "Show users"
msgstr "vertoon gebruikers"

#: kdm-users.cpp:151
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, KDM will not show any users. If one of the "
"alternative radio buttons is selected, KDM will show a list of users in its "
"login dialog, so users can click on their name and image rather than typing "
"in their login."
msgstr ""
"as hierdie opsie is gekose, kdm sal nie vertoon enige gebruikers. as een van "
"die alternatiewe radio knoppies is gekose, kdm sal vertoon 'n lys van "
"gebruikers in sy aanteken dialoog, sodat gebruikers kan kliek op hulle naam "
"en beeld eerder as te tik in hulle aanteken."

#: kdm-users.cpp:155
msgid "Selected onl&y"
msgstr "gekose slegs"

#: kdm-users.cpp:156
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, KDM will only show the users listed in the "
"\"selected users\" listbox in its login dialog."
msgstr ""
"as hierdie opsie is gekose, kdm sal slegs vertoon die gebruikers gelys in "
"die \"gekose gebruikers\" lyshokkie in sy aanteken dialoog."

#: kdm-users.cpp:158
msgid "A&ll but no-show"
msgstr "alle maar no-show"

#: kdm-users.cpp:159
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, KDM will show all users but those who are listed "
"in the \"no-show users\" listbox or have user ID less then the one specified "
"in the \"Hide UIDs\" fields (except root)."
msgstr ""
"as hierdie opsie is gekose, kdm sal vertoon alle gebruikers maar daardie wie "
"word gelys in die \"no-vertoon gebruikers\" lyshokkie of het gebruiker id "
"minder dan word die een gespesifiseer in die \"steek weg uids\" velde "
"(behalwe root)."

#: kdm-users.cpp:162
msgid "Sor&t users"
msgstr "sorteer gebruikers"

#: kdm-users.cpp:164
msgid ""
"This option tells KDM to alphabetically sort the users shown in its login "
"dialog."
msgstr ""
"hierdie opsie sê vir kdm aan alfabeties sorteer die gebruikers vertoon in "
"sy aanteken dialoog."

#: kdm-users.cpp:167
msgid "Hide U&IDs"
msgstr "steek weg uids"

#: kdm-users.cpp:168
msgid ""
"In \"All but no-show\"-mode all users with a user ID less/greater than these "
"numbers are hidden. Note, that the root user is not affected by this and "
"must be explicitly listed in \"No-show users\" to be hidden."
msgstr ""
"in \"alle maar no-show\"-mode alle gebruikers met 'n gebruiker id "
"minder/grootter as hierdie nommers word weg gesteekte. nota, wat die root "
"gebruiker is nie geaffekteer deur hierdie en moet wees eksplisiet gelys in "
"\"No-show gebruikers\" aan wees weg gesteekte."

#: kdm-users.cpp:173
msgid "below"
msgstr "onder"

#: kdm-users.cpp:179
msgid "above"
msgstr "boonste"

#: kdm-users.cpp:247
msgid "Save image as default image?"
msgstr "stoor beeld as verstek beeld?"

#: kdm-users.cpp:257
msgid ""
"There was an error saving the image:\n"
"%1\n"
msgstr ""
"daar was 'n fout stooring die beeld:\n"
"%1\n"

#: kdm-users.cpp:301
msgid ""
"There was an error loading the image:\n"
"%1\n"
"It will not be saved..."
msgstr ""
"daar was 'n fout laaiïng van die beeld:\n"
"%1\n"
"dit sal nie wees gestoor..."

#: kdm-conv.cpp:47
msgid "Automatic login"
msgstr "automaties aanteken"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:49
msgid "Enable au&to-login"
msgstr "aktiveer auto-login"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:50
msgid ""
"Turn on the auto-login feature. This applies only to KDM's graphical login. "
"Think twice before enabling this!"
msgstr ""

#: kdm-conv.cpp:56
msgid "Truly automatic lo&gin"
msgstr "waarlike automaties aanteken"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:57
msgid ""
"When this option is on, the auto-login will be carried out immediately when "
"KDM starts (i.e., when your computer comes up). When this is off, you will "
"need to initiate the auto-login by crashing the X server (by pressing "
"alt-ctrl-backspace)."
msgstr ""
"wanneer hierdie opsie is op, die auto-login sal wees gevoer uit dadelik "
"wanneer kdm beginne (i.e., wanneer jou rekenaar kom begin). wanneer hierdie "
"is af, jy sal benodig aan inisieer die auto-login deur laat omval die x "
"bediener (deur gedruk alt-ctrl-backspace)."

#: kdm-conv.cpp:65
msgid "Use&r:"
msgstr "gebruiker:"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:67
msgid "Select the user to be logged in automatically from this list."
msgstr "kies die gebruiker aan wees gelog in automaties van hierdie lys."

#: kdm-conv.cpp:76
msgid "Preselect User"
msgstr "vooraf kies gebruiker"

