"Click here to add the highlighted user on the left to the list of selected "
"users on the right, i.e. users that are allowed in without entering their "
"password."
msgstr ""
"kliek hier aan voeg by die verlig gebruiker op die links aan die lys van "
"gekose gebruikers op die regterkant, i.e. gebruikers wat word toegelaat in "
"sonder om te in te tik hulle wagwoord."

#: kdm-conv.cpp:153
msgid "Automatically log in again after &X server crash"
msgstr "automaties log in weer na x bediener omval"

#: kdm-conv.cpp:154
msgid ""
"When this option is on, a user will be logged in again automatically, when "
"his session is interrupted by an X server crash. Note, that this can open a "
"security hole: if you use another screen locker than kdesktop's integrated "
"one, this will make circumventing a password-secured screen lock possible."
msgstr ""

